    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "\xBFEh? \xBFQu\xE9? \xBFCuanto he dormido? \xBFQu\xE9 hora es?"
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: Hala, que tarde es. Casi es hora de cenar.
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "Snif, snif. Puaj, huelo fatal. Estoy todo sudado. Ser\xE1 mejor que antes
      me de un ba\xF1o."
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 27b2fd31505d4cb1b184ca32befc4c0c, type: 3}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "A ver, Ayame me dijo que el ba\xF1o estaba al fondo. \xBFDonde estar\xE1
      por cierto?"
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 27b2fd31505d4cb1b184ca32befc4c0c, type: 3}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "A ver, Ayame me dijo que el ba\xF1o estaba al fondo. "
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 2800000, guid: eef48a9009bd12b4ab993a4603b11ae3, type: 3}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: 
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "Lo encontr\xE9. A ver, creo que puedo dejar la ropa por aqu\xED. Y aqu\xED
      hay un par de toallas limpias."
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 2800000, guid: eef48a9009bd12b4ab993a4603b11ae3, type: 3}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: toalla
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "El ba\xF1o me va a sentar genial."
    isThought: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 2800000, guid: eef48a9009bd12b4ab993a4603b11ae3, type: 3}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: toalla
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "(Cuando abro la puerta lo primero que oigo es un suave tarareo procedente
      del interior del ba\xF1o. Decido ignorarlo. Mi primer error.) "
    isThought: 1
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 2800000, guid: eef48a9009bd12b4ab993a4603b11ae3, type: 3}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: toalla
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: (El vapor empieza a disiparse y una silueta se empieza a definir, parece
      una persona. Se gira hacia mi y me mira con unos ojos profundos y azules. Su
      mirada se clava en mis ojos. Yo, por el contrario, examino todo su cuerpo intentando
      memorizar todas sus formas. Segudno error.)
    isThought: 1
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
  - background: {fileID: 2800000, guid: eef48a9009bd12b4ab993a4603b11ae3, type: 3}
    musicAction: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    soundEffectVolume: 0
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1665d2ed1296b4d4598f2f6b08458726, type: 2}
    outfit: toalla
    expression: 
    reactions: []
    speaker: 
    text: "(Pronuncia mi nombre extra\xF1ada. Yo sigo paralizado en el umbral del
      ba\xF1o.)"
    isThought: 1
    speakerSide: 0
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    hideLeftCharacter: 0
    hideRightCharacter: 0
